---
/**
 * Hero Section per la Home Page di Brilla Cafe.
 * Presentazione calda, ambrata e focalizzata sui 3 reparti + pickup in negozio.
 */
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-8 pb-16 lg:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-cream via-brand-cream to-white">
  
  {/* Elementi decorativi di sfondo */}
  <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-amber/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-24 w-80 h-80 bg-badge-cartoleria/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      {/* Testi e CTA */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-center lg:text-left">
        
        {/* Badge Locale CRO */}
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-amber/15 border border-brand-amber/30 text-brand-dark text-xs font-bold tracking-wide shadow-2xs">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-amber animate-ping" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>Castelnuovo Bocca d'Adda (LO) · Servizio Scegli &amp; Ritira</span>
        </div>

        {/* Titolo principale ad alto impatto */}
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-brand-dark tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
          Il tuo shop di fiducia per <span class="text-badge-cartoleria">Cartoleria</span>, <span class="text-emerald-700">Edicola</span> &amp; <span class="text-rose-600">Idee Regalo</span>.
        </h1>

        <div class="space-y-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0">
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-brand-dark font-bold leading-snug">
            Ordina online in 30 secondi e ritira subito al bancone a Castelnuovo Bocca d'Adda, senza costi di spedizione.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-dark/75 leading-relaxed">
            La comodità del digitale unita all'accoglienza di sempre: un caffè al volo e il tuo ordine di scuola, ufficio o riviste già impacchettato e pronto da ritirare al bancone.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* CTA Buttons orientati alla conversione (CRO) */}
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-2">
          <a
            href="/catalogo"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-brand-cyan hover:bg-brand-cyan/90 text-white text-sm font-bold rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-brand-cyan/25 hover:shadow-xl transition-all text-center focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-[#2C3E50]"
          >
            ⚡ Ordina e Ritira al Banco
          </a>

          <a
            href="/catalogo?tipo=cartoleria"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-4 bg-white hover:bg-brand-dark/5 text-brand-dark border border-brand-dark/15 text-sm font-bold rounded-2xl transition-all text-center focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-[#2C3E50]"
          >
            🎒 Esplora il Reparto Scuola
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

      {/* Vetrina Visiva Hero */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-md lg:max-w-none">
          
          {/* Card Principale Illustrata */}
          <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-white aspect-[4/5] bg-brand-cream">
            <img
              src="/cappuccino.avif"
              alt="Cappuccino e atmosfera accogliente di Brilla Cafe a Castelnuovo Bocca d'Adda"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="eager"
              fetchpriority="high"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-dark/80 via-brand-dark/20 to-transparent"></div>
            
            {/* Tag in overlay */}
            <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 text-white">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-brand-amber text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-lg inline-block mb-2 shadow-sm">
                Benvenuti al Brilla
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Un caffè, il tuo giornale preferito e i quaderni per la scuola.</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-white/80 mt-1">Via Umberto I, 35 · Castelnuovo Bocca d'Adda</p>
            </div>
          </div>


        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
